sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User shell
  participant G as gh (token from keyring)
  participant API as api.github.com
  participant ACT as Actions service
  participant R as Runner VMs
  U->>G: git push origin hotfix/1.2.12
  Note over U,API: plain git transport, not the API
  U->>G: gh pr create --base main --fill
  G->>API: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls
  API-->>G: 201 Created, PR URL
  API->>ACT: event pull_request (opened)
  ACT->>R: queue 4 matrix jobs (gates 3.10/3.12/3.13/3.14)
  U->>G: gh pr checks URL --watch
  loop every --interval seconds (default 10)
    G->>API: query check states of the PR head
    API-->>G: pending / success / failure per check
  end
  R-->>ACT: job results (exit codes of steps)
  ACT-->>API: check runs completed
  G-->>U: exit 0 (all passed) or 1 (failed)
  U->>G: gh pr merge URL --merge --delete-branch
  G->>API: merge request for the PR
  API-->>G: merged (only if branch protection satisfied)
